{"unit_id":"LAU-MARS__dsh-cad#card-zh","repo":"LAU-MARS/dsh-cad","commit":"050d51927ff77071eaa0fe1d0160db4fc24b07b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad 是面向 DSH Web 的 CAD 插件，提供交互式 2D/3D 查看器和参数化建模工具。它注册 CAD 工具并在会话中呈现模型卡片，也可挂载常驻侧栏面板。用户可以查看 STL、OBJ、STEP、IGES、BREP、DCPRT、DXF 与 SVG，读取几何尺寸，创建和编辑实体、草图、装配与工程图，并导出模型。它适合机械设计、模型检查和工程制图工作流。内置几何内核无需额外 CAD 软件；选择 Onshape 云执行时需配置其 API 凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:98-115","src/tools/cad-view.ts:31-41","src/tools/cad-info.ts:19-27","src/tools/cad-model.ts:548-553"]}
{"unit_id":"LAU-MARS__dsh-cad#card-en","repo":"LAU-MARS/dsh-cad","commit":"050d51927ff77071eaa0fe1d0160db4fc24b07b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cad adds a CAD viewer and parametric modeling to DSH Web. It opens common 2D/3D formats, reports geometry, creates parts and assemblies, generates drawings, and exports models. A side panel tracks edits. Built-in modeling needs no separate CAD app; Onshape use needs API credentials.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:98-115","src/tools/cad-view.ts:31-41","src/tools/cad-info.ts:19-27","src/tools/cad-model.ts:548-553"]}
