{"unit_id":"LAU-MARS__dsh-cad#feature-view-3d","repo":"LAU-MARS/dsh-cad","commit":"050d51927ff77071eaa0fe1d0160db4fc24b07b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad 的功能「交互查看 CAD 文件」：在聊天视图打开 STL、OBJ、STEP、IGES、BREP 或 DCPRT。调用 cad_view 并提供工作区文件路径，返回可旋转缩放的模型卡片及几何摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools/cad-view.ts:31-41"]}
{"unit_id":"LAU-MARS__dsh-cad#feature-measure","repo":"LAU-MARS/dsh-cad","commit":"050d51927ff77071eaa0fe1d0160db4fc24b07b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad 的功能「读取几何信息」：cad_info 不生成查看器，直接返回格式、部件或实体数量、边界、单位和 DXF 图层。输入是工作区中的 CAD 文件路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools/cad-info.ts:19-27","src/tools/cad-info.ts:35-44"]}
{"unit_id":"LAU-MARS__dsh-cad#feature-model","repo":"LAU-MARS/dsh-cad","commit":"050d51927ff77071eaa0fe1d0160db4fc24b07b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad 的功能「参数化建模」：通过 cad_create_prim 创建盒体、圆柱、球、圆锥或圆环，按毫米指定尺寸、位置和方向，后续建模工具可引用返回的 bodyId。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools/cad-model.ts:548-567"]}
{"unit_id":"LAU-MARS__dsh-cad#feature-sketch","repo":"LAU-MARS/dsh-cad","commit":"050d51927ff77071eaa0fe1d0160db4fc24b07b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad 的功能「草图与特征建模」：工具族支持创建、编辑和列出草图，并将轮廓拉伸、扫掠、放样或旋转为实体。调用相应 cad_* 工具提交参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools/cad-model.ts:631-677","src/tools/cad-model.ts:815-860"]}
